>MbhC
āhārārthaṃ samārambhas tava cāyaṃ vihaṃgama | śakyaś cāpy anyathā kartum āhāro 'py adhikas tvayā || 15 ||
>MbhS
āhārārthaṃ samārambhas_ tava cāyaṃ vihaṅgama | śakyaś cāpy anyathā kartum_ āhāro 'py adhikas tvayā || 15 ||
>VpBh
āhārārthe samārambhas tava cāyaṃ vihaṅgamaḥ | tad yathaiva tavāhāraṃ manyase tad dadāmy aham || 39 ||
